   "evidence": "GradedAlgebra.lean:87-104 (`private theorem mk_mul_mk_comm`, with `hcup` at 90-102); the special case proved independently: FieldTheory/GaloisCohomology/MuTwo/Cup.lean:90-100 `kummerCup_comm`, whose proof re-does `TopPairing.cup_gradedComm` + `trivialF2TopPairing_flip` + sign removal at `(1,1)`. Grep for `cup_comm|cup_symm` under ContCohomology returns only `trivialF2TopPairing_bil_comm` (coefficient level) and `explicitCup00_comm`, so no public all-bidegree statement exists.",
