   "issue": "The `have hcup` inside the private `mk_mul_mk_comm` is the general statement \"the mod-two cup product is symmetric in every bidegree\": `(trivialF2TopPairing G).cup m n x y = (degreeCast (trivialF2 G) (Nat.add_comm n m)).hom ((trivialF2TopPairing G).cup n m y x)`. It is kept private and only at the `GradedMonoid.mk`/`GCommRing` level, so the repo still proves the bidegree-(1,1) case by hand in `kummerCup_comm`, and a consumer at general `(m, n)` cannot cite it (recovering it from `DirectSum.of_mul_of` plus `mul_comm` needs Sigma/degree-cast wrangling).",
